---
import Demo from '../shared/Demo.astro';
---

<section class="lib-section cl-section" id="article">
    <div class="lib-section-title">📄 Article</div>
    <div class="lib-section-desc">
        Semantic <code>&lt;article&gt;</code> structure with <code>header</code>, body content, and <code>footer</code>. The scoping element for <code>_native.css</code> styles.
    </div>

    <Demo is:raw label="Article with header / body / footer">
        <article>
            <header>
                <h2>Article Title</h2>
                <p>Published <time datetime="2025-04-27">April 27, 2025</time> · 5 min read</p>
            </header>
            <p>This is the article body. It can contain paragraphs, images, lists, code, and any other semantic HTML elements — all styled automatically.</p>
            <p>A second paragraph with <strong>strong emphasis</strong> and <em>italic text</em> to demonstrate the base typography rhythm.</p>
            <footer>
                <p>Written by <a href="#">Author Name</a> · <a href="#">Feedback</a></p>
            </footer>
        </article>
    </Demo>
</section>
